* Seven-band graphic EQ: Rev 1 from Tom Whitwell / Music Thing Modular.
* Source: https://musicthing.co.uk/collateral/graphic_schematic.pdf
* BOM: https://github.com/TomWhitwell/Graphic (Rev 1 workbook).
* Faders are unspecified in schematic/BOM: ASSUME 10k linear, unverified.
* NE5532 approximated single-pole A0=100000 GBW=10MHz; no clipping/slew/noise.
* Ideal source; 1Meg external load; LEDs and supply decoupling omitted.
* 0dBFS = 0.5V peak pending rail check.
.subckt opamp inp inn out
G1 0 p inp inn 100
Rp p 0 1k
Cp p 0 1.591549430919u
E1 out 0 p 0 1
.ends
$SOURCE
R25 in im 10k
R26 im io 10k
XIN 0 im io opamp
R1 io plus 2.7k
XOUT plus minus eo opamp
R2 minus eo 2.7k
R3 eo out 470
RL out 0 1meg
RP0T minus w0 {max(10000*(1-$B63),1)}
RP0B w0 plus {max(10000*$B63,1)}
C0_0 w0 a0 4.7e-07
C0_1 w0 a0 4.7e-07
C0_2 w0 a0 3.3e-07
CS0 a0 b0 2.2e-08
RG0 b0 0 130000.0
XF0 b0 o0 o0 opamp
RF0 a0 o0 1800
RP1T minus w1 {max(10000*(1-$B160),1)}
RP1B w1 plus {max(10000*$B160,1)}
C1_0 w1 a1 4.7e-07
C1_1 w1 a1 3.3e-08
CS1 a1 b1 1e-08
RG1 b1 0 110000.0
XF1 b1 o1 o1 opamp
RF1 a1 o1 1800
RP2T minus w2 {max(10000*(1-$B410),1)}
RP2B w2 plus {max(10000*$B410,1)}
C2_0 w2 a2 1e-07
C2_1 w2 a2 1e-07
CS2 a2 b2 4.7e-09
RG2 b2 0 91000.0
XF2 b2 o2 o2 opamp
RF2 a2 o2 1800
RP3T minus w3 {max(10000*(1-$B1K),1)}
RP3B w3 plus {max(10000*$B1K,1)}
C3_0 w3 a3 4.7e-08
C3_1 w3 a3 3.3e-08
CS3 a3 b3 2.2e-09
RG3 b3 0 82000.0
XF3 b3 o3 o3 opamp
RF3 a3 o3 1800
RP4T minus w4 {max(10000*(1-$B2K5),1)}
RP4B w4 plus {max(10000*$B2K5,1)}
C4_0 w4 a4 3.3e-08
CS4 a4 b4 1e-09
RG4 b4 0 68000.0
XF4 b4 o4 o4 opamp
RF4 a4 o4 1800
RP5T minus w5 {max(10000*(1-$B7K7),1)}
RP5B w5 plus {max(10000*$B7K7,1)}
C5_0 w5 a5 1e-08
C5_1 w5 a5 2.2e-09
CS5 a5 b5 4.7e-10
RG5 b5 0 62000.0
XF5 b5 o5 o5 opamp
RF5 a5 o5 1800
RP6T minus w6 {max(10000*(1-$B16K),1)}
RP6B w6 plus {max(10000*$B16K,1)}
C6_0 w6 a6 4.7e-09
CS6 a6 b6 2.2e-10
RG6 b6 0 51000.0
XF6 b6 o6 o6 opamp
RF6 a6 o6 1800
$ANALYSIS
.end
